wpewebkit (2.54.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * debian/control:
    - Build depend on architecture-is-little-endian. Due to Skia,
      WebKitGTK does not build on big-endian machines.
    - Remove build dependency on libwoff-dev. Freetype has built-in WOFF2
      support since 2.10.2 so a separate library is no longer needed.
    - Add build dependency on libinput-dev and libenchant-2-dev.
  * Refresh all patches and remove fix-ftbfs-sparc64.patch, since
    big-endian is no longer supported.
  * Update copyright information of all files.
  * debian/source/lintian-overrides:
    - Update source-is-missing overrides.
  * debian/libwpewebkit-2.0-1.symbols:
    - Update symbols.
  * debian/not-installed:
    - Ignore mimalloc files that are installed by default in some
      architectures (e.g. armhf) even though we don't need them.

